Comment:
 rynas-caddy is Caddy built unmodified from a pinned upstream release with xcaddy,
 packaged for rynas (https://github.com/rylos/rynas, packaging/caddy). The binary
 statically links Go modules under permissive licenses (Apache-2.0, BSD, MIT, MPL-2.0);
 their exact list and versions are in the go.mod/go.sum of the Caddy release and
 printed by `rynas-caddy build-info`.

